      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the friendly greetings and thoughtful guidance offered by the team in Chinatown. Reviewers note that staff members listen closely to styling preferences and send status updates by text. A solitary customer reported a dispute over nail trimming, but others describe helpful assistance."
      }
    },
