      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle care for timid pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents describe patient handling for young puppies, squirmy dogs, and anxious rescues during grooming sessions. Several reviewers mention that pets stay calm and come out alert after visits. Groomers take time to ease animals into tools and perform gentle health routine checks."
      }
    }
